---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Tags
description: Every topic I've written about on this blog.
permalink: /blog/tags/
---
{% if collections.postTags.length %}
<ul class="tag-list">
	{% for tag in collections.postTags %}
	{% set tagged = collections[tag] | default([]) %}
	<li><a href="/blog/tags/{{ tag | slugify }}/">{{ tag }}</a> ({{ tagged.length }})</li>
	{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p>No tags yet.</p>
{% endif %}
<p><a href="/blog/">Back to the blog</a></p>
